              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Can develop acutely due to trauma or a coagulopathy, or neoplasia; may also be",
              "pdf_page": 688,
              "printed_page": 606,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "chronic.",
              "pdf_page": 688,
              "printed_page": 606,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Cardiovascular and respiratory systems commonly affected.",
